bobr - multi-origin content delivery edge with transforms and optimizations

DEPENDENCIES
  - Go 1.25+
  - libvips libwebp libheif

BUILD
  make

RUN
  ./bin/bobr -c config/config.yaml

CONFIG
  See config/config.yaml for S3, cache, and host settings.

TRANSFORMS
  ?width=N    Resize to width (maintains aspect ratio)
  ?height=N   Resize to height (maintains aspect ratio)
  ?crop=X     Crop position: center, top, bottom, left, right

Set transform: true and/or optimize: true per host in config.
